    "encrypted": "false",
    "display_name": "Going Shopping",
    "long_instructions": "**Just because you want something doesn’t mean you should buy it.**\r\n\r\n**☑️ Do This:**\r\n\r\n- Fix the `decide` function to help someone decide whether they should buy something:\r\n  - If they want it and can afford it, they should \"Buy it.\"\r\n  - If they want it but can’t afford it, they should \"Save for it.\"\r\n  - If they don’t want it but can afford it, they should \"Skip it.\"\r\n  - If they don’t want it and can’t afford it, they should \"Ignore it.\"\r\n- If you finish with time to spare, expand your decision tree with more questions.\r\n",
    "bubble_choice_description": "Build a decision tree to go shopping.",
    "thumbnail_url": "https://images.code.org/15db47e2166f771d4cb87e554fa1af2c-shopping.jpg",
